# VINCE stack

- Frontend: Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind. Colors black and blue. Inter body, Poppins display.
- Default UI hides Merkle/continuity details; advanced panel may show them.
- Copy must distinguish proof verified vs market condition satisfied.
- Contracts: Solidity + Hardhat. No `setPrice`. No verification bypass.
- Use `@gluwa/usc-sdk` for proofs. Do not hand-roll a prover without an ADR.
